{title: 668 - O Thou Who Hearest}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #668 • MORECAMBE • 11.10.10.12}
{lyricist: Frederick A. Jackson}
{composer: Frederick Atkinson}
{key: Bb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 668}
{meta: tune MORECAMBE}
{meta: meter 11.10.10.12}
{meta: category Sentences and Responses - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]O Thou who hearest every [Cm]heartfelt [Bb]prayer,
[Gm]With [A]Thy [A7/Db]rich [Dm]grace, Lord, [F/C]all our [Cm]hearts prepare;
[F]Thou art our [F7]life, Thou art our love and light,
[Bb]Olet [Cm]this [Bb/D]Sabbath [Eb]hour [Bb/F]with Thee [Gm]be [Bb/F]bright. [F7]Amen.
{end_of_verse}
